  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sierra Leone CBHP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The British Red Cross is supporting the Sierra Leone Red Cross Society (SLRCS) to reduce exposure to health risks and increase community resilience in Sierra Leone through: (1) Reducing the vulnerability of target populations to communicable diseases (HIV and AIDS Malaria); (2) Increasing the preparedness of SLRCS branches and communities to respond to community health emergencies; (3) Improving access to and use of safe water supplies and latrines by target communities and schools; and (4) Increasing the capacity of the SLRCS Headquarters and branches to deliver a quality health programme.</narrative>
  </description>
